        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Choose Your Account Size</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Transparent metrics. Pass Phase 1 (12%) and Phase 2 (8%), verify your KYC, and start trading funded institutional accounts.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- MODELS -->
      <div id="models" class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-12">
