          <i data-lucide="trending-up" class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400 mb-3"></i>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Scaling Plan up to $1M</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Generate 10% profit over 3 months for 25% account balance boosts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400 mb-3"></i>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Bi-Weekly Payouts</div>
