        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" class="py-20 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-emerald-400 mb-3">Help Center</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="font-semibold text-white pr-4">What are the profit targets for the 2-Phase evaluation?</div>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition flex-shrink-0"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Phase 1 requires a 12% profit target. Phase 2 requires 8%. Both phases mandate a minimum of 3 trading days to prevent gambling-based pass attempts.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="font-semibold text-white pr-4">What are the maximum drawdown limitations?</div>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition flex-shrink-0"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Maximum daily loss is 4% and maximum total loss is 8% of the initial account balance. Breaching either limit results in automatic failure of the evaluation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="font-semibold text-white pr-4">How do I receive my cTrader credentials after payment?</div>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition flex-shrink-0"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Credentials are generated after your crypto transaction is verified. Your cTrader login, password, and server IP will be displayed in your dashboard and emailed to your registered address.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="font-semibold text-white pr-4">Is news trading and weekend holding allowed?</div>
            <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition flex-shrink-0"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Yes! Traders are permitted to hold swing trades over the weekend and execute during major news releases without penalty. High-frequency arbitrage and latency abuse are prohibited.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

